### REST Client. Isi environment proses sebelum membuka VS Code.
### KATALOGKU_TEST_EMAIL harus unik, KATALOGKU_TEST_PASSWORD minimal 10 karakter.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@email = {{$processEnv KATALOGKU_TEST_EMAIL}}
@password = {{$processEnv KATALOGKU_TEST_PASSWORD}}
@productId = {{list.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}
@userId = {{login.response.body.$.record.id}}

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Daftar produk
# @name list
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?perPage=5&sort=-created

### Pencarian
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?filter=title~%27kopi%27

### Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### Registrasi akun pengujian baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/records
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Uji REST Client","email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}","passwordConfirm":"{{password}}"}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/auth-with-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"identity":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Tambah favorit
# @name favorite
POST {{baseUrl}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"user":"{{userId}}","product_id":"{{productId}}"}

### Favorit sendiri
GET {{baseUrl}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hapus record yang baru dibuat
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/favorites/{{favorite.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bersihkan akun pengujian yang dibuat pada urutan ini
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/auth/records/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
